[2026-06-12T13:59:13.904Z] [Backend] Response for GET / (status 200): [{"id":"cmq9pjdhd0018xexammvdc5q8","title":"Valid Parentheses","description":"## Valid Parentheses\n\nGiven a string `s` containing just the characters `'('`, `')'`, `'{'`, `'}'`, `'['` and `']'`, determine if the input string is valid.\n\nAn input string is valid if:\n1. Open brackets must be closed by the same type of brackets.\n2. Open brackets must be closed in the correct order.\n3. Every close bracket has a corresponding open bracket of the same type.\n\n#### Example 1\n\nInput\n\n```\n()\n```\n\nOutput\n\n```\ntrue\n```\n\n#### Example 2\n\nInput\n\n```\n()[{}]\n```\n\nOutput\n\n```\ntrue\n```\n\n#### Example 3\n\nInput\n\n```\n(]\n```\n\nOutput\n\n```\nfalse\n```\n\n#### Constraints\n\n- `1 <= s.length <= 10^4`\n- `s` consists of parentheses only `'()[]{}'`.\n","hidden":false,"slug":"valid-parentheses","solved":0,"createdAt":"2026-06-11T16:24:00.769Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-11T19:25:40.726Z","difficulty":"EASY","defaultCode":[{"id":"cmq9pjdln001axexapieu037e","languageId":2,"problemId":"cmq9pjdhd0018xexammvdc5q8","code":"#include <bits/stdc++.h>\nusing namespace std;\n\nclass Solution {\npublic:\n    bool solve(string s) {\n        \n    }\n};\n","createdAt":"2026-06-11T16:24:00.923Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-11T19:25:40.881Z"},{"id":"cmq9pjdpx001cxexauh9ywo1g","languageId":4,"problemId":"cmq9pjdhd0018xexammvdc5q8","code":"#include <stdio.h>\n#include <stdlib.h>\n#include <string.h>\n#include <stdbool.h>\n\nbool solve(char* s) {\n    \n}\n","createdAt":"2026-06-11T16:24:01.077Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-11T19:25:41.040Z"},{"id":"cmq9pjdx6001exexaf8xb06w4","languageId":5,"problemId":"cmq9pjdhd0018xexammvdc5q8","code":"import java.util.*;\n\nclass Solution {\n    public boolean solve(String s) {\n        \n    }\n}\n","createdAt":"2026-06-11T16:24:01.338Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-11T19:25:41.199Z"},{"id":"cmq9pje2i001gxexa10fsi2le","languageId":6,"problemId":"cmq9pjdhd0018xexammvdc5q8","code":"class Solu